      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasta Natani weesa Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea goobiida Dawdi gheanyi gwayeesha Dawdi Natani was sibaneeda, “Ng'ula, aniini geabiiti gheeda sisna gubooyeeka, nea sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA goobiita jeeda maheemajeanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Natani ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Sina ng'asheega sean bwariiy gurooroadaang'u, aba gideaba ASEETA gwanda badaydaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba jeedeaba eaweedida ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Natani ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Una ak giyeeshi siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi, ‘Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Ang'iing'i maydeasa gheeda jea deabiida jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini mii deabiida jeeda gheeda ghang'eada eaweeda earuuni Israeli Misri ea ghoah askweareani bea ghamneawean, ak ghaamwanyi maheemajeanji ea maheemajeanji ak ghaabeawi hoorgeeni ak geawi hoorgeeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba heeda wassean aamwanyi sea Israeleesean, neada ea neargu ng'asheanda sea siida wassean laja girgweaguutka bea Israeli, ak gearukusi fuga arear buuneedeanyu, nea geeyeeshi, “Ghwasaan inyas mii adeeknean gheeda sideasa gubooyeeka?”’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa eeshiina siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi, ‘Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, aniini geayeananeey haghweeda nea giihaaghwi gisilga, ak gaydanung' huwa siida haw jea goombal fugeasu was Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geendeayi sea ang'iing'i aba heeda wassean uwi, ak ghaasaji weajoodigaagu sean aba madeadaang'u; ak gaydeamajeek gheawungaagu, gawuurji gheawunga fuga hees bea jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaloat heechea goobiida fugeasu was Israeli, ak gaydang'aapta saawa, ak goobiida ng'eanyiida nyaawa, ak ea mudeebiikta eeteawiit earahay; nea fuga ng'ooweata ea maygudu gabiikta goodeawiit earahay gawuurji gidaghayi bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada damanda ghayi aaloadi fuga laja girgweaguutka jea goombal fugeasu was Israeli; ak aniini gaydajoar weajoodigaagu sean. Gicha gaydargu gideaba gaygwadeekneey NG'UTAMIIDA gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahita damandaang'u jea beawana heeda ghweanigaagu, gaydang'eat jeataang'u jea gamaseawneey, was orjeanagi aba jeeda orjoagaagu, ak gaydeamajeek sugoocheanduumeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwadeeknean gheeda, ak gaydeamajeek hoorgeadaanyi damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydoaw ghwaan, ak gayghoah orjeedeanyu; ak ea maydageandeawa headaanyi bariinyeegeasu bea huumwa, maygawuurji gidaghayi eageandeaydi aba heeda siida ghayi mida madeadaang'u, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny gaydeamajeek aba jeedeaba gheenyu ea aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeedeanyu damanda manda muudeanooda nea hoorgeadaanyi gajeemajeek damanda manda muudeanooda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawuurji gidabeada ng'asheesu seaniin, ak gawuurji gidabeada ng'asheega sean siihiimsa, ghayi rukusa Natani Dawdi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghamwaash ASEETA nea gabadiischeesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa sugoocheanda was Dawdi jeeda gheeda ak goopteada aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha, “Aniini neada geawooschi ng'eaha, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ak gheenyu ea naaha, ea lamwaja eanean hiji sheagi ayang'uun? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheanji aamwanang' aba madeeda gheanyangaagu, Ea ASEETA; ak giibalooli eara gheeda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda aba gweanyeeka saang'a jea ghwahidu, ak giihiimnaani seaygoojiga jea ghwahidu, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaygwayeeshiineeyiin Dawdi gicha aba iita mureeda sisissa siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda? Aba gideaba ang'iing'i ginali siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, aba badayda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ea aba gurooroadaang'u, gisini ng'asheesu hees seaniin ak abeeda geanal ng'asheesu hees seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida uurjeeweey ang'iing'i, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea manda ASEETA nuut murdeadaang'u, aba gidanyaashta ng'asheega sean ghayi siyiinyi aba iidigaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada gwanda aneamwa aba jeeda ng'eanyiida uurji fugaagu was Israeli, ghayi weah ASEETA gwalealu ghoah fugaaschi, ak gisisi geaw gheawunga aba ng'asheega hees ea gea deamdeameadi, ak gihoani eemoojiga aba madeeda fugaagu ghayi ilealu aba Misri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ginung' ghoah fugaagu was Israeli fugaagu damanda manda muudeanooda; nea ang'iing'i, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, gihuuwi ASEETA nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, nung' ng'asheanda ghayi irugu aba badayda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ea badaydeaba gheanyi gamajeegiit damanda manda muudeanooda, ak gisini gidaghayi iyeeni gaysina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geemajeek gheawungaagu nea geakghaambiit damanda manda muudeanooda, nea gwayi, ‘NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli, niny ASEETA Israeli’; sea gheeda siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi gajeemajeek aba madeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ang'iing'i, guwoosi ASEETEANYU, ak ea niihiimsi siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gideaba gaydeeksiina niny gheeda; ak ea ninyas siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda uurda jea ghamwaashaneey aba madeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ang'iing'i guwoosi ASEETA, ak ea niheeleesi gidamiy siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gagasa hoosana ak giidawi ghawooda gheeda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ak gagasa goobiida madeadaang'u damanda manda muudeanooda; aba gideaba ghawooda ang'iing'i, ea NG'UTAMIIDA, siitaw ghawooda damanda manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
